    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστρᾰτ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>march</i>
			<i>against, make war upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					784
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1522
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.54
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1351b20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοὺς Ἕλληνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.680.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὴν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.107
