				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.83
				</span></i>
			: in Poets c. acc. loci, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πατρίδα τὴν ταύτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					362
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐβοῖδα χώραν</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
