					Id.
					<u>IA</u>
					1154
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.60
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				92
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					780
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατῷ ξύμπαντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1056
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεζῷ καὶ ναυσί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nic.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, with pf.
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστρατεύεσθαι ἐπ᾽ Αἴγυπτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.107
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				6.132
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc. loci, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				605
			</span></i>.</div>
